      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "You coffee and dessert taste average.\nBut i appreciate other menu. I come only for having dinner 🫰🏻\n\nAmbience best, spacious dan cold. Lots of charger port. Very supportive for working remotely ~ Just source your dessert from better place. Would be nice to have a decent cake there.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "You coffee and dessert taste average.\nBut i appreciate other menu. I come only for having dinner 🫰🏻\n\nAmbience best, spacious dan cold. Lots of charger port. Very supportive for working remotely ~ Just source your dessert from better place. Would be nice to have a decent cake there.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
