      "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNyN3FLRGV3EAE!2m1!1s0x2e69edd6207ebfd7:0x327e1bc382cff6b1"
    },
    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ179-INbtaS4RsfbPgsMbfjI/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCNFBTNnpBRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 years ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "My biggest problem about this place is the mosquitos!! It feels like I have invaded their breeding place. They need to do something about it ASAP!\nThey have updated their menu. More variety than previously.  But for the drink, Bonbon Noir is still the best for me. Now I can say its a place to hang out, work and also to dine. The speed of their service is also upgraded. But coming in on Friday afternoon maybe also helped. It was less crowded.\nThe ambience of this place is still top notch. The staff is friendlier than before, but some still need to smile more.\nThe parking space for cars are rare, but there is a parking lot next to the café if you are lucky. They charge you 3000 rupiah to park your motorcycle. A good fee in my opinion.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "My biggest problem about this place is the mosquitos!! It feels like I have invaded their breeding place. They need to do something about it ASAP!\nThey have updated their menu. More variety than previously.  But for the drink, Bonbon Noir is still the best for me. Now I can say its a place to hang out, work and also to dine. The speed of their service is also upgraded. But coming in on Friday afternoon maybe also helped. It was less crowded.\nThe ambience of this place is still top notch. The staff is friendlier than before, but some still need to smile more.\nThe parking space for cars are rare, but there is a parking lot next to the café if you are lucky. They charge you 3000 rupiah to park your motorcycle. A good fee in my opinion.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
