      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "This place has awesome atmosphere, and have 3 area, first one have Air Conditioner you can bring child here,\nSecond one open area it refreshing and sometimes have live performance, third one outside area/ smoking area with roof, recommend if you like to enjoy fresh air but not get direct sunlight,\n\ni recommend to visit at afternoon or night since it would be best to enjoy open air and vibes.\nThe food was good and drink are also nice.",
